 beautiful, I would be honored if you drew him!\nHe is 19 years old, and he is 176 cm tall. He has red eyes, gray skin and hair, and a pair of curved goat horns. He was an assassin who serves a great demon.However, he has currently lost his memory and become a naive wandering bard. Although he sometimes shows a cruel and ruthless side, he is more like a child.\nI have no other specific requirements, so please feel free to draw! You can also dress him in any other clothing you'd like to draw.\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-NoZJXPsZBGYHTAPL78obmeFrWZArbs7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ssamanthass/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b255dc43/uploads/origins/2719af28-acc9-41ba-beba-52359355f2da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dc0efc58d85ffe3ee9f4649b22f55b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b255dc43/uploads/origins/2719af28-acc9-41ba-beba-52359355f2da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dc0efc58d85ffe3ee9f4649b22f55b5, https://si.imgix.net/b255dc43/uploads/origins/2719af28-acc9-41ba-beba-52359355f2da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a91e18c84be4dde44a679b9370d3f10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b255dc43/uploads/origins/2719af28-acc9-41ba-beba-52359355f2da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44ef0224be9f209c62b90e1a9e95a905 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたからのアピールをいただき、とても光栄です！あなたの絵はとても美しく、BALMを描きたいと聞いて嬉しくなりました。♡\n\nアピールメッセージでご提案いただいたアイデア、どれも素敵ですね！ぜひぜひ進めてみてください！ご参考までに、以前からの参考リンクも載せておきますね。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21swk2u2bwi5\nhttps://skeb.jp/@_tuno4/works/22\n\nどんな風に描かれるのか、とても楽しみです。^^ ♡\n\n今回もありがとうございました！素敵な一日をお過ごしください！\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21swk2u2bwi5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ssamanthass/works/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/798fcca4/uploads/origins/d1f77b64-b858-44b9-8ba7-a7168df94830?